sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant R as FastAPI runner
    participant S as AgenticStrategy
    participant H as Search
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant C as Claude API
    UI->>R: GET stream for question
    R->>S: answer(question)
    S->>C: stream(question, tools)
    loop up to AGENT_MAX_TOOL_CALLS tool calls
        C-->>S: assistant turn with tool_use blocks
        S->>S: echo assistant turn into messages
        alt tool budget not reached
            alt list_manuals
                S->>DB: manuals
                DB-->>S: id, title, owner, section count
            else search
                S->>H: hybrid_search(query, k=8, manual_id)
                H->>DB: FTS5 and vector candidates
                DB-->>H: chunks
                H-->>S: top hits
            else read_section
                S->>DB: section(section_id)
                DB-->>S: heading path and full text
            end
            S-->>R: TraceStep tool_call, name, input, summary
            R-->>UI: SSE trace
        else budget reached
            Note over S: remaining tool_use blocks get an is_error<br/>tool_result, plus a notice to answer now
        end
        S->>C: one user message with all tool_results
    end
    C-->>S: final text with section id markers, status tag
    S-->>R: TextDelta without status tag
    R-->>UI: SSE delta
    S->>DB: look up each cited section
    S->>S: resolve section markers to [n], strip status tag
    S-->>R: Final answer, citations, metrics
    R-->>UI: SSE final
    R->>DB: save answer and trace to log
